{
  "schema": "neyvia.manual.v1",
  "id": "documents",
  "kind": "workflow",
  "proofs": {
    "area": "documents",
    "contracts": [
      {
        "checkedAt": [
          "grant_agent.neyvia_documents.run",
          "grant_agent.study_docs.create",
          "grant_agent.study_docs.build",
          "grant_agent.proofs_documents.self_check"
        ],
        "claim": "documents.create writes a course document with one concept per chapter; documents.build compiles it with Tectonic and the PDF shows the six labelled blocks and every chapter.",
        "id": "documents.create.course",
        "impact": [
          "templates/latex/neyvia-study/neyvia-study.cls",
          "documents.create",
          "documents.build"
        ],
        "phase": "post"
      },
      {
        "checkedAt": [
          "grant_agent.study_docs.check",
          "grant_agent.proofs_documents.self_check"
        ],
        "claim": "On a clean document every outcome check passes from the produced files: no TeX errors, no undefined references, no overfull box over 1 pt, Inter embedded, blocks in order with tags, page count within the limit.",
        "id": "documents.checks.pass",
        "impact": [
          "documents.check"
        ],
        "phase": "post"
      },
      {
        "checkedAt": [
          "grant_agent.study_docs.check",
          "grant_agent.study_docs.concepts",
          "grant_agent.proofs_documents.self_check"
        ],
        "claim": "A document with blocks out of order, an untagged concept, an undefined reference and an overfull line still compiles but fails the blocks, references and overfull checks, each naming the fault.",
        "id": "documents.checks.catch",
        "impact": [
          "documents.check",
          "neyvia-study.cls aux records"
        ],
        "phase": "post"
      },
      {
        "checkedAt": [
          "grant_agent.study_docs.build",
          "grant_agent.proofs_documents.self_check"
        ],
        "claim": "The sheet variant builds from the same source, prints method and reflex and drops traps and practice.",
        "id": "documents.sheet.variant",
        "impact": [
          "templates/latex/neyvia-study/neyvia-study.cls"
        ],
        "phase": "post"
      },
      {
        "checkedAt": [
          "grant_agent.study_docs.render",
          "grant_agent.proofs_documents.self_check"
        ],
        "claim": "documents.render writes the requested page as a non-blank PNG under D:/NeyviaRuns/docs.",
        "id": "documents.render.pages",
        "impact": [
          "documents.render"
        ],
        "phase": "post"
      },
      {
        "checkedAt": [
          "grant_agent.study_docs.glance",
          "grant_agent.proofs_documents.self_check"
        ],
        "claim": "Without an attached LAYA judge documents.glance reports not available and never passes.",
        "id": "documents.glance.pending",
        "impact": [
          "documents.glance",
          "LAYA page glance"
        ],
        "phase": "invariant"
      },
      {
        "checkedAt": [
          "grant_agent.neyvia_workspace_tools.tool_specs",
          "grant_agent.study_docs.toolchain",
          "grant_agent.proofs_documents.self_check"
        ],
        "claim": "The five documents tools are workspace tools and the toolchain (Tectonic binary and bundled Inter) is present.",
        "id": "documents.tools.registered",
        "impact": [
          "neyvia.documents.*"
        ],
        "phase": "invariant"
      }
    ]
  },
  "schemas": {
    "neyvia.documents.build": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "path"
      ]
    },
    "neyvia.documents.check": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "maxPages": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 2000
        },
        "require": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[1-6]{1,6}$"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "path"
      ]
    },
    "neyvia.documents.create": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "variant": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "course",
            "sheet"
          ]
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "chapters": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "minItems": 1,
          "maxItems": 40
        },
        "subtitle": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "sourcePrefix": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "overwrite": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "path",
        "variant",
        "title",
        "chapters"
      ]
    },
    "neyvia.documents.glance": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "pages": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^(all|[0-9]+(-[0-9]+)?(,[0-9]+(-[0-9]+)?)*)$"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "path"
      ]
    },
    "neyvia.documents.render": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "path": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1
        },
        "pages": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^(all|[0-9]+(-[0-9]+)?(,[0-9]+(-[0-9]+)?)*)$"
        },
        "dpi": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 40,
          "maximum": 300
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "path"
      ]
    }
  },
  "chapters": {
    "overview": {
      "title": "Study documents: Paul's six-block template, Tectonic build, outcome checks and page renders",
      "state": {
        "document": {
          "args": {
            "path": {
              "$input": "path"
            }
          },
          "inputs": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "path": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "path"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "shape": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "ok": {
                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "passed": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "total": {
                "type": "integer"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "ok",
              "passed",
              "total"
            ]
          },
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.check"
        }
      },
      "actions": {
        "documents.create": {
          "effect": "Create a study document on Paul's neyvia-study template: course (six blocks per concept) or sheet (formula, method, reflex); one chapter per title.",
          "pre": "A workspace path for a new .tex file; overwrite only when asked",
          "returns": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "reversible": true,
          "schema": "neyvia.documents.create",
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.create"
        },
        "documents.build": {
          "effect": "Compile a study document with Tectonic (XeTeX, Inter bundled); returns the PDF, log, seconds and page count.",
          "pre": "An existing .tex on the neyvia-study class; Tectonic installed (study_docs.py setup)",
          "returns": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "reversible": true,
          "schema": "neyvia.documents.build",
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.build"
        },
        "documents.check": {
          "effect": "Run the outcome checks on a built study document: compiles, references, overfull boxes, Inter embedded, block order and source tags, page count.",
          "pre": "The document was built by documents.build",
          "returns": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "reversible": true,
          "schema": "neyvia.documents.check",
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.check"
        },
        "documents.render": {
          "effect": "Render pages of a built study document to PNG files on D:/NeyviaRuns/docs.",
          "pre": "The document was built by documents.build",
          "returns": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "reversible": true,
          "schema": "neyvia.documents.render",
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.render"
        },
        "documents.glance": {
          "effect": "Ask the attached LAYA page-glance judge whether rendered pages look broken; reports not available until a judge is attached.",
          "pre": "The document was built; a LAYA judge attached through NEYVIA_LAYA_GLANCE",
          "returns": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "reversible": true,
          "schema": "neyvia.documents.glance",
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.glance"
        }
      },
      "checks": {
        "compiles": {
          "args": {
            "path": {
              "$input": "path"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "op": "eq",
            "path": "compiles",
            "value": true
          },
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.check"
        },
        "references": {
          "args": {
            "path": {
              "$input": "path"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "op": "eq",
            "path": "references",
            "value": true
          },
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.check"
        },
        "overfull": {
          "args": {
            "path": {
              "$input": "path"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "op": "eq",
            "path": "overfull",
            "value": true
          },
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.check"
        },
        "inter-embedded": {
          "args": {
            "path": {
              "$input": "path"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "op": "eq",
            "path": "interEmbedded",
            "value": true
          },
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.check"
        },
        "blocks": {
          "args": {
            "path": {
              "$input": "path"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "op": "eq",
            "path": "blocks",
            "value": true
          },
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.check"
        },
        "pages": {
          "args": {
            "path": {
              "$input": "path"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "op": "eq",
            "path": "pages",
            "value": true
          },
          "tool": "neyvia.documents.check"
        }
      },
      "procedures": {
        "new-document": {
          "goal": "Create a document from Paul's template, build it, check every outcome and render pages to look at",
          "inputs": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "path": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "variant": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "course",
                  "sheet"
                ]
              },
              "title": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              },
              "chapters": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 40
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "path",
              "variant",
              "title",
              "chapters"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "documents.create",
              "args": {
                "chapters": {
                  "$input": "chapters"
                },
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                },
                "title": {
                  "$input": "title"
                },
                "variant": {
                  "$input": "variant"
                }
              },
              "save": "created"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.build",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "check": "compiles",
              "save": "built"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.check",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "check": "blocks",
              "save": "checked"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.render",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "save": "pages"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.glance",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "save": "glance"
            },
            {
              "judge": "pages-look-right"
            }
          ]
        },
        "build-and-check": {
          "goal": "Rebuild an edited document and prove it still compiles cleanly with every concept in block order",
          "inputs": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "path": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "path"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "documents.build",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "check": "compiles",
              "save": "built"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.check",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "check": "references",
              "save": "checked"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.check",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "check": "overfull",
              "save": "layout"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.check",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "check": "inter-embedded",
              "save": "fonts"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.check",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "check": "blocks",
              "save": "concepts"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.check",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "check": "pages",
              "save": "length"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.render",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "save": "pages"
            },
            {
              "action": "documents.glance",
              "args": {
                "path": {
                  "$input": "path"
                }
              },
              "save": "glance"
            },
            {
              "judge": "pages-look-right"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "judge": {
        "pages-look-right": {
          "constraints": "The pluggable LAYA page glance (documents.glance) answers this once attached; until then a person looks at the PNGs from documents.render. A missing judge is never a pass.",
          "kind": "human",
          "options": [
            "looks-fine",
            "looks-broken"
          ],
          "question": "Do the rendered pages look right: no clipped boxes, overlapping text, empty or half-empty pages?"
        }
      },
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "failure": "Tectonic is missing",
          "recovery": "Run python scripts/study_docs.py setup --install: it fetches the official GitHub release (about 21 MB) to D:/NeyviaRuns/tectonic/bin."
        },
        {
          "failure": "A package is not in the cache",
          "recovery": "documents.build retries online once and Tectonic fetches only that package into D:/NeyviaRuns/tectonic/cache; later builds run offline."
        },
        {
          "failure": "Inter is not embedded",
          "recovery": "The class loads Inter by file name from templates/latex/neyvia-study/fonts, which the build puts on the search path; elsewhere set \\studyfontpath{dir/}."
        },
        {
          "failure": "Overfull box over 1 pt",
          "recovery": "Split the long formula over several \\step or \\dline lines, one transformation per line; never shrink the font."
        },
        {
          "failure": "Blocks out of order or a concept without a tag",
          "recovery": "Reorder to definition, method, reflex, worked, traps, practice and give \\begin{concept}{title}{tag} the source page and column."
        },
        {
          "failure": "Undefined reference",
          "recovery": "Fix the \\ref label; a second build pass never hides a missing label."
        }
      ],
      "frontier": [
        "The LAYA page glance is a pluggable step: documents.glance hands the page PNGs to the command in NEYVIA_LAYA_GLANCE and reports not available until another component attaches it.",
        "The six-part format is the same structure Scroll Study card packs use (paul-seven-part.v1): definition = FORMULA with WHEN?, method = WHAT DO I WRITE?, reflex = PATTERN, worked = COURSE EXAMPLE, practice = YOUR EXERCISE, traps = VARIATIONS/TRAPS. One source can feed both; the converter is not built yet.",
        "Paul's own Complete Course has concepts with no method (19 of 199) or no worked example (41 of 199), so the block check requires definition and reflex and reports the others; require 1234 makes it strict.",
        "Ports of chapter 1 of the Complete Course and the Formula & Method Sheet onto the class place all 58 concept headings at the original page and position; scripts/study_docs.py port and compare reproduce it."
      ],
      "guidance": [
        "Template: templates/latex/neyvia-study/neyvia-study.cls, \\documentclass[course] or [sheet]; examples in examples/. Writing rules: plugins/neyvia/skills/neyvia-study-docs/SKILL.md.",
        "A concept is \\begin{concept}{title}{source tag} with blocks definition, method{caption}, reflex, worked{caption}, traps, practice in that order. The sheet keeps 1-3 and drops 4-6, so one source builds both.",
        "Lines: \\step{...} one transformation per line (a leading Let, Assume, Then, Take, Check, We look for is coloured), \\dline{maths}, \\result{maths}, \\trap{...}, \\try{...} with \\answer{...}. Quantifiers \\forall \\exists \\exists! colour themselves.",
        "Builds and renders go to D:/NeyviaRuns/docs; never put PDFs or PNGs in the workspace."
      ]
    }
  }
}
